# Keep the build context small and, above all, keep secrets and local state out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
.claude
README.md

# The frontend is deployed to S3, not shipped in this image. Only its manifest is needed for `npm ci`.
frontend/*
!frontend/package.json
